    LLM: 'Game: Kaiserspiel. Logic: Win the tricks, card points, or contract result required by the local form of the game.',
    Player: 'Kaiserspiel is a traditional trick-taking card game using 40 or 48-card Swiss Kaiserspiel deck for 2, 4, or 6 players. It uses one chosen suit and belongs to the Karnöffel environment.',
